					"nextDialogs": [
						10151109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151109,
					"content": "旅人が見聞きしてきたことは旅人自身がゆっくりと味わえ。そうだ、共に「送仙儀式」を準備してくれた礼に——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151110,
					"content": "お前に馳走を奢ってやろう。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151111,
						10151112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151111,
					"content": "鍾離先生が…奢る？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10151113,
					"content": "ん？ああ、安心しろ。今回はちゃんと、モラを持っていく。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151114,
					"content": "今夜、お前を市場でも評判の港の老舗へ連れて行く。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151115,
					"content": "港の老舗？酒の店か？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151116,
					"content": "そうだ。埠頭付近の「三杯酔」で待っているぞ。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151112,
